<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Abhishek Kumar v. State of NCT of Delhi, BAIL APPLN. 4485/2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Justice Mini Pushkarna</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Decided</th><td>4 November 2026</td></tr>
